{"id":"97edf2306af6f30e","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-filter2-preimage-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Preimage Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter2-preimage-filter — ZFC Filter2 Preimage Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-preimage-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-preimage-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-preimage-filter — ZFC Filter2 Preimage Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-preimage-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-preimage-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-preimage-filter — ZFC Filter2 Preimage Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H,f,\\mathcal G,X,Y,A,B,C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal H,f,\\mathcal G,X,Y,A,B,C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2PreimageFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2PreimageFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}preimage\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2PreimageFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,f,\\mathcal G,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal G,Y)\n\\land\\mathcal H=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal G\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\subseteq A)\\}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}preimage\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2PreimageFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,f,\\mathcal G,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal G,Y)\n\\land\\mathcal H=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal G\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\subseteq A)\\}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The source filter and the map now use their registered predicates; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> is the filter generated by their preimages.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (filter predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal H,f,\\mathcal G,X,Y,A,B,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2PreimageFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}preimage\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2PreimageFilter}_S(\\mathcal H,f,\\mathcal G,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal G,Y)\n\\land\\mathcal H=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal G\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\subseteq A)\\}\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false}],"bytes":1219